  "notes": [
    "Regular -AR verb with a spelling change: **c → qu before e**, to preserve the hard \"k\" sound",
    "Only affects the yo form of the pretérito indefinido (toqué, not \"tocé\") and the entire subjuntivo presente/imperativo (toque, toques...)",
    "No stem changes; regular past participle: **tocado**",
    "Two common meanings: \"to touch\" (physically) and \"to play\" (a musical instrument): *tocar la guitarra* (to play the guitar)",
    "Also used impersonally: *me toca a mí* (it's my turn), *toca trabajar* (time to work)",
    "Common usage: *no tocar* (do not touch — common sign), *tocar el timbre* (to ring the doorbell)"
  ],
